cf-heritage-ancient-blooded-dwarf = Ancient-Blooded Dwarf
cf-heritage-ancient-blooded-dwarf-desc = Before a save against magic, you can call up a short bonus to magical saves.
cf-heritage-death-warden-dwarf = Death Warden Dwarf
cf-heritage-death-warden-dwarf-desc = A success against a void effect, or an effect from an undead creature, becomes a critical success.
cf-heritage-forge-dwarf = Forge Dwarf
cf-heritage-forge-dwarf-desc = Fire resistance equal to half your level, and environmental heat is one step less extreme.
cf-heritage-rock-dwarf = Rock Dwarf
cf-heritage-rock-dwarf-desc = You are harder to shove, trip, or force to move, and long forced movement is cut in half.
cf-heritage-strong-blooded-dwarf = Strong-Blooded Dwarf
cf-heritage-strong-blooded-dwarf-desc = Poison resistance equal to half your level, and a successful save cuts a poison down faster.

cf-heritage-ancient-elf = Ancient Elf
cf-heritage-ancient-elf-desc = You gain the multiclass dedication of a class other than your own.
cf-heritage-arctic-elf = Arctic Elf
cf-heritage-arctic-elf-desc = Cold resistance equal to half your level, and environmental cold is one step less extreme.
cf-heritage-cavern-elf = Cavern Elf
cf-heritage-cavern-elf-desc = You can see in darkness.
cf-heritage-seer-elf = Seer Elf
cf-heritage-seer-elf-desc = You can cast detect magic at will, and you are better at identifying magic and reading magical writing.
cf-heritage-whisper-elf = Whisper Elf
cf-heritage-whisper-elf-desc = You are better at finding creatures you can hear, and those creatures are easier to target when they hide.
cf-heritage-woodland-elf = Woodland Elf
cf-heritage-woodland-elf-desc = You climb plants faster, and you can Take Cover in a forest without an obstacle.

cf-heritage-chameleon-gnome = Chameleon Gnome
cf-heritage-chameleon-gnome-desc = You can shift your colors. Matching the area gives you a bonus to Stealth.
cf-heritage-fey-touched-gnome = Fey-Touched Gnome
cf-heritage-fey-touched-gnome-desc = You gain the fey trait and one primal cantrip you can swap once each day.
cf-heritage-sensate-gnome = Sensate Gnome
cf-heritage-sensate-gnome-desc = Imprecise scent out to 30 feet, and a bonus to find creatures you can smell.
cf-heritage-umbral-gnome = Umbral Gnome
cf-heritage-umbral-gnome-desc = You can see in darkness.
cf-heritage-wellspring-gnome = Wellspring Gnome
cf-heritage-wellspring-gnome-desc = Choose arcane, divine, or occult. You gain one cantrip of that tradition, and later gnome spells use it too.

cf-heritage-charhide-goblin = Charhide Goblin
cf-heritage-charhide-goblin-desc = Fire resistance equal to half your level, and persistent fire is easier to put out.
cf-heritage-irongut-goblin = Irongut Goblin
cf-heritage-irongut-goblin-desc = You can live on garbage, and sickness from something you ate is much easier to resist.
cf-heritage-razortooth-goblin = Razortooth Goblin
cf-heritage-razortooth-goblin-desc = Your jaws are a finesse unarmed attack that deals 1d6 piercing damage.
cf-heritage-snow-goblin = Snow Goblin
cf-heritage-snow-goblin-desc = Cold resistance equal to half your level, and environmental cold is one step less extreme.
cf-heritage-unbreakable-goblin = Unbreakable Goblin
cf-heritage-unbreakable-goblin-desc = Ancestry Hit Points are 10 instead of 6, and falls count as half the distance.

cf-heritage-gutsy-halfling = Gutsy Halfling
cf-heritage-gutsy-halfling-desc = A success against an emotion effect becomes a critical success.
cf-heritage-hillock-halfling = Hillock Halfling
cf-heritage-hillock-halfling-desc = Add your level to Hit Points from a night's rest, and from Treat Wounds if you eat a snack.
cf-heritage-jinxed-halfling = Jinxed Halfling
cf-heritage-jinxed-halfling-desc = You cannot take Halfling Luck. Once a day you can curse a creature you can see with the clumsy condition.
cf-heritage-nomadic-halfling = Nomadic Halfling
cf-heritage-nomadic-halfling-desc = Two extra languages, and each time you take Multilingual you learn one more.
cf-heritage-twilight-halfling = Twilight Halfling
cf-heritage-twilight-halfling-desc = You can see in dim light as if it were bright.
cf-heritage-wildwood-halfling = Wildwood Halfling
cf-heritage-wildwood-halfling-desc = Plants and fungi do not count as difficult terrain for you.

cf-heritage-skilled-human = Skilled Human
cf-heritage-skilled-human-desc = You become trained in one skill, and an expert in that skill at 5th level.
cf-heritage-versatile-human = Versatile Human
cf-heritage-versatile-human-desc = You gain one general feat you qualify for.

cf-heritage-cactus-leshy = Cactus Leshy
cf-heritage-cactus-leshy-desc = Your spines are a finesse unarmed attack that deals 1d6 piercing damage.
cf-heritage-fruit-leshy = Fruit Leshy
cf-heritage-fruit-leshy-desc = Each dawn grows a fruit. Eaten within an hour, it heals 1d8 Hit Points, plus more after 1st level.
cf-heritage-fungus-leshy = Fungus Leshy
cf-heritage-fungus-leshy-desc = You can see in darkness. You lose the plant trait and gain the fungus trait.
cf-heritage-gourd-leshy = Gourd Leshy
cf-heritage-gourd-leshy-desc = Store up to 1 Bulk in your head. A single stored item can be drawn as part of using it.
cf-heritage-leaf-leshy = Leaf Leshy
cf-heritage-leaf-leshy-desc = You take no damage from falling.
cf-heritage-lotus-leshy = Lotus Leshy
cf-heritage-lotus-leshy-desc = You can walk on still liquids at half Speed, and try to cross flowing water the same way.
cf-heritage-root-leshy = Root Leshy
cf-heritage-root-leshy-desc = Ancestry Hit Points are 10 instead of 8. You last longer without sunlight and are harder to move.
cf-heritage-seaweed-leshy = Seaweed Leshy
cf-heritage-seaweed-leshy-desc = Land Speed drops by 5 feet. You have a swim Speed of 20 feet and can breathe underwater.

cf-heritage-badlands-orc = Badlands Orc
cf-heritage-badlands-orc-desc = You can Hustle twice as long, and environmental heat is one step less extreme.
cf-heritage-battle-ready-orc = Battle-Ready Orc
cf-heritage-battle-ready-orc-desc = You are trained in Intimidation and gain Intimidating Glare.
cf-heritage-deep-orc = Deep Orc
cf-heritage-deep-orc-desc = You gain Terrain Expertise for underground terrain and the Combat Climber feat.
cf-heritage-grave-orc = Grave Orc
cf-heritage-grave-orc-desc = Void resistance equal to half your level, and a bonus against death and void effects.
cf-heritage-hold-scarred-orc = Hold-Scarred Orc
cf-heritage-hold-scarred-orc-desc = Ancestry Hit Points are 12 instead of 10, and you gain the Diehard feat.
cf-heritage-rainfall-orc = Rainfall Orc
cf-heritage-rainfall-orc-desc = A bonus to Climb and Swim, and a bonus against disease.
cf-heritage-winter-orc = Winter Orc
cf-heritage-winter-orc-desc = You are trained in Survival, and environmental cold is one step less extreme.

cf-heritage-clawed-catfolk = Clawed Catfolk
cf-heritage-clawed-catfolk-desc = Your claws are an agile finesse unarmed attack that deals 1d6 slashing damage.
cf-heritage-hunting-catfolk = Hunting Catfolk
cf-heritage-hunting-catfolk-desc = Imprecise scent out to 30 feet, and a bonus to Track something you have smelled.
cf-heritage-jungle-catfolk = Jungle Catfolk
cf-heritage-jungle-catfolk-desc = Undergrowth is easier to move through, and thick undergrowth is only difficult terrain.
cf-heritage-liminal-catfolk = Liminal Catfolk
cf-heritage-liminal-catfolk-desc = Detect magic as an occult cantrip, and a bonus to recall knowledge of creatures from other planes.
cf-heritage-nine-lives-catfolk = Nine Lives Catfolk
cf-heritage-nine-lives-catfolk-desc = While dying, recovery checks ignore your dying value. You gain Diehard.
cf-heritage-sharp-eared-catfolk = Sharp-Eared Catfolk
cf-heritage-sharp-eared-catfolk-desc = A bonus to Seek creatures you can hear, and once a round you can Point Out one of them for free.
cf-heritage-winter-catfolk = Winter Catfolk
cf-heritage-winter-catfolk-desc = Cold resistance equal to half your level, and environmental cold is one step less extreme.

cf-heritage-elfbane-hobgoblin = Elfbane Hobgoblin
cf-heritage-elfbane-hobgoblin-desc = Before a save against magic, you can add a bonus, and a larger one if the effect is arcane.
cf-heritage-runtboss-hobgoblin = Runtboss Hobgoblin
cf-heritage-runtboss-hobgoblin-desc = You gain Group Coercion, and Coerce checks against goblins improve by one step.
cf-heritage-shortshanks-hobgoblin = Shortshanks Hobgoblin
cf-heritage-shortshanks-hobgoblin-desc = You gain the Ride feat, and you are not off-guard while climbing.
cf-heritage-smokeworker-hobgoblin = Smokeworker Hobgoblin
cf-heritage-smokeworker-hobgoblin-desc = Fire resistance equal to half your level, and smoke alone does not conceal a target from you.
cf-heritage-warmarch-hobgoblin = Warmarch Hobgoblin
cf-heritage-warmarch-hobgoblin-desc = A failed Subsist check in the wild still feeds you poorly, and you can Hustle twice as long.
cf-heritage-warrenbred-hobgoblin = Warrenbred Hobgoblin
cf-heritage-warrenbred-hobgoblin-desc = Underground, creatures you can hear are easier to target, and a successful Squeeze becomes a critical success.

cf-heritage-ant-kholo = Ant Kholo
cf-heritage-ant-kholo-desc = You are Small instead of Medium, and you are trained in Deception.
cf-heritage-cave-kholo = Cave Kholo
cf-heritage-cave-kholo-desc = You can see in darkness.
cf-heritage-dog-kholo = Dog Kholo
cf-heritage-dog-kholo-desc = With both hands free, your Speed becomes 30 feet as you run on all fours.
cf-heritage-great-kholo = Great Kholo
cf-heritage-great-kholo-desc = Ancestry Hit Points are 10 instead of 8, and you have a bonus to Reposition, Shove, and Trip.
cf-heritage-sweetbreath-kholo = Sweetbreath Kholo
cf-heritage-sweetbreath-kholo-desc = You are trained in Diplomacy, and you have a bonus to Make an Impression on someone who can smell you.
cf-heritage-winter-kholo = Winter Kholo
cf-heritage-winter-kholo-desc = Cold resistance equal to half your level, and environmental cold is one step less extreme.
cf-heritage-witch-kholo = Witch Kholo
cf-heritage-witch-kholo-desc = You can cast figment at will, and your voice is better at diversions and impersonations.

cf-heritage-cavernstalker-kobold = Cavernstalker Kobold
cf-heritage-cavernstalker-kobold-desc = You climb natural stone faster, and a successful Squeeze becomes a critical success.
cf-heritage-dragonscaled-kobold = Dragonscaled Kobold
cf-heritage-dragonscaled-kobold-desc = Ancestry Hit Points are 10 instead of 6, and you have a bonus against dragon breath, sleep, and paralysis.
cf-heritage-elementheart-kobold = Elementheart Kobold
cf-heritage-elementheart-kobold-desc = Choose an element. You gain resistance to its damage equal to half your level.
cf-heritage-spellhorn-kobold = Spellhorn Kobold
cf-heritage-spellhorn-kobold-desc = One arcane cantrip at will. Charisma is your spellcasting ability for it.
cf-heritage-strongjaw-kobold = Strongjaw Kobold
cf-heritage-strongjaw-kobold-desc = Your jaws are a finesse unarmed attack that deals 1d6 piercing damage.
cf-heritage-tunnelflood-kobold = Tunnelflood Kobold
cf-heritage-tunnelflood-kobold-desc = You have a swim Speed of 15 feet.
cf-heritage-venomtail-kobold = Venomtail Kobold
cf-heritage-venomtail-kobold-desc = Once a day you can poison a piercing or slashing weapon so its next hit deals persistent poison damage.

cf-heritage-cliffscale-lizardfolk = Cliffscale Lizardfolk
cf-heritage-cliffscale-lizardfolk-desc = You gain Combat Climber, can climb with your feet, and a successful Climb becomes a critical success.
cf-heritage-cloudleaper-lizardfolk = Cloudleaper Lizardfolk
cf-heritage-cloudleaper-lizardfolk-desc = If you have room to spread your skin flaps, you take no damage from a fall.
cf-heritage-frilled-lizardfolk = Frilled Lizardfolk
cf-heritage-frilled-lizardfolk-desc = Demoralize is visual and ignores language. Striding in and succeeding frightens the foe more.
cf-heritage-sandstrider-lizardfolk = Sandstrider Lizardfolk
cf-heritage-sandstrider-lizardfolk-desc = Fire resistance, heat and thirst are easier, and cold is harsher unless you find shelter.
cf-heritage-unseen-lizardfolk = Unseen Lizardfolk
cf-heritage-unseen-lizardfolk-desc = You can shift your colors. Matching the area gives you a bonus to Stealth.
cf-heritage-wetlander-lizardfolk = Wetlander Lizardfolk
cf-heritage-wetlander-lizardfolk-desc = You have a swim Speed of 15 feet.
cf-heritage-woodstalker-lizardfolk = Woodstalker Lizardfolk
cf-heritage-woodstalker-lizardfolk-desc = You can Take Cover in forest or jungle without an obstacle, and you gain Terrain Stalker for underbrush.

cf-heritage-deep-rat = Deep Rat
cf-heritage-deep-rat-desc = You can see in darkness.
cf-heritage-desert-rat = Desert Rat
cf-heritage-desert-rat-desc = With both hands free your Speed becomes 30 feet. Heat and thirst are easier, and cold is harsher without shelter.
cf-heritage-longsnout-rat = Longsnout Rat
cf-heritage-longsnout-rat-desc = Imprecise scent out to 30 feet, and a bonus to Seek within that scent.
cf-heritage-sewer-rat = Sewer Rat
cf-heritage-sewer-rat-desc = You are immune to putrid plague, and a success against disease or poison becomes a critical success.
cf-heritage-shadow-rat = Shadow Rat
cf-heritage-shadow-rat-desc = You are trained in Intimidation and can coerce or demoralize animals, but animals start less friendly.
cf-heritage-snow-rat = Snow Rat
cf-heritage-snow-rat-desc = Cold resistance equal to half your level, and environmental cold is one step less extreme.
cf-heritage-tunnel-rat = Tunnel Rat
cf-heritage-tunnel-rat-desc = You gain Quick Squeeze, and tight spaces that are not a squeeze are not difficult terrain.

cf-heritage-dogtooth-tengu = Dogtooth Tengu
cf-heritage-dogtooth-tengu-desc = Your beak unarmed attack gains the deadly d8 trait.
cf-heritage-jinxed-tengu = Jinxed Tengu
cf-heritage-jinxed-tengu-desc = A success against a curse or misfortune becomes a critical success, and incoming doomed can be reduced.
cf-heritage-mountainkeeper-tengu = Mountainkeeper Tengu
cf-heritage-mountainkeeper-tengu-desc = You can cast vitality lash at will, and tengu spells can be divine or primal.
cf-heritage-skyborn-tengu = Skyborn Tengu
cf-heritage-skyborn-tengu-desc = You take no damage from falling.
cf-heritage-stormtossed-tengu = Stormtossed Tengu
cf-heritage-stormtossed-tengu-desc = Electricity resistance equal to half your level, and rain or fog alone does not conceal a target from you.
cf-heritage-taloned-tengu = Taloned Tengu
cf-heritage-taloned-tengu-desc = Your talons are an agile finesse unarmed attack that deals 1d4 slashing damage and can deal piercing instead.
cf-heritage-wavediver-tengu = Wavediver Tengu
cf-heritage-wavediver-tengu-desc = You have a swim Speed of 15 feet.

cf-heritage-poisonhide-tripkee = Poisonhide Tripkee
cf-heritage-poisonhide-tripkee-desc = When a creature touches you, you can deal poison damage that grows as you level.
cf-heritage-riverside-tripkee = Riverside Tripkee
cf-heritage-riverside-tripkee-desc = You have a swim Speed of 15 feet.
cf-heritage-snaptongue-tripkee = Snaptongue Tripkee
cf-heritage-snaptongue-tripkee-desc = Your tongue can deliver touch spells and simple interactions such as opening an unlocked door.
cf-heritage-stickytoe-tripkee = Stickytoe Tripkee
cf-heritage-stickytoe-tripkee-desc = You are harder to disarm or force to move, and a successful Climb on plants becomes a critical success.
cf-heritage-thickskin-tripkee = Thickskin Tripkee
cf-heritage-thickskin-tripkee-desc = Ancestry Hit Points are 8 instead of 6, and you have a bonus against disease and poison.
cf-heritage-windweb-tripkee = Windweb Tripkee
cf-heritage-windweb-tripkee-desc = With one hand free, you take no damage from falling.

cf-heritage-ancient-scale-azarketi = Ancient Scale Azarketi
cf-heritage-ancient-scale-azarketi-desc = Old scales make you harder to injure, and you can hold your breath longer.
cf-heritage-benthic-azarketi = Benthic Azarketi
cf-heritage-benthic-azarketi-desc = You can see in the dark of deep water.
cf-heritage-inured-azarketi = Inured Azarketi
cf-heritage-inured-azarketi-desc = Cold and the pressure of the deep bother you less than other people.
cf-heritage-mistbreath-azarketi = Mistbreath Azarketi
cf-heritage-mistbreath-azarketi-desc = You breathe air and water, and you can exhale a brief cloud of mist.
cf-heritage-murkeyed-azarketi = Murkeyed Azarketi
cf-heritage-murkeyed-azarketi-desc = Murky water, rain, and fog do not conceal creatures from you.
cf-heritage-river-azarketi = River Azarketi
cf-heritage-river-azarketi-desc = You swim more easily and keep your footing in a current.
cf-heritage-spined-azarketi = Spined Azarketi
cf-heritage-spined-azarketi-desc = Your spines are a finesse unarmed attack.
cf-heritage-tactile-azarketi = Tactile Azarketi
cf-heritage-tactile-azarketi-desc = In the water you can feel nearby movement as an imprecise sense.

cf-heritage-artisan-android = Artisan Android
cf-heritage-artisan-android-desc = You are trained in Crafting and have a specialty craft.
cf-heritage-impersonator-android = Impersonator Android
cf-heritage-impersonator-android-desc = Once a day you can take on another person's appearance and are better at keeping up that disguise.
cf-heritage-laborer-android = Laborer Android
cf-heritage-laborer-android-desc = You are trained in Athletics and can carry more than your frame suggests.
cf-heritage-polyglot-android = Polyglot Android
cf-heritage-polyglot-android-desc = You learn extra languages, and Multilingual teaches one more each time you take it.
cf-heritage-warrior-android = Warrior Android
cf-heritage-warrior-android-desc = You are trained in one weapon group of your choice.

cf-heritage-bright-fetchling = Bright Fetchling
cf-heritage-bright-fetchling-desc = You can shed light, and glare is less likely to blind you.
cf-heritage-deep-fetchling = Deep Fetchling
cf-heritage-deep-fetchling-desc = Your darkvision reaches farther, and darkness helps you hide.
cf-heritage-liminal-fetchling = Liminal Fetchling
cf-heritage-liminal-fetchling-desc = You can cast detect magic as an occult cantrip.
cf-heritage-resolute-fetchling = Resolute Fetchling
cf-heritage-resolute-fetchling-desc = You have a bonus against mental and emotion effects.
cf-heritage-wisp-fetchling = Wisp Fetchling
cf-heritage-wisp-fetchling-desc = Once a day you can blur into shadow and become concealed.

cf-heritage-created-fleshwarp = Created Fleshwarp
cf-heritage-created-fleshwarp-desc = Your body was assembled. Disease and poison meant for a natural body are easier to resist.
cf-heritage-mutated-fleshwarp = Mutated Fleshwarp
cf-heritage-mutated-fleshwarp-desc = A spare limb helps you climb and hold on when something tries to move you.
cf-heritage-shapewrought-fleshwarp = Shapewrought Fleshwarp
cf-heritage-shapewrought-fleshwarp-desc = A half-finished transformation left you harder to polymorph or force into a new shape.
cf-heritage-technological-fleshwarp = Technological Fleshwarp
cf-heritage-technological-fleshwarp-desc = Grafts and metal in your body can be repaired, and you resist electricity.

cf-heritage-celestial-envoy-kitsune = Celestial Envoy Kitsune
cf-heritage-celestial-envoy-kitsune-desc = You know a divine cantrip and are better at speaking with spirits.
cf-heritage-dark-fields-kitsune = Dark Fields Kitsune
cf-heritage-dark-fields-kitsune-desc = Dim light and darkness make you harder to find.
cf-heritage-earthly-wilds-kitsune = Earthly Wilds Kitsune
cf-heritage-earthly-wilds-kitsune-desc = You are trained in Survival, and plants are easier for you to move through.
cf-heritage-empty-sky-kitsune = Empty Sky Kitsune
cf-heritage-empty-sky-kitsune-desc = You take no damage from falling.
cf-heritage-frozen-wind-kitsune = Frozen Wind Kitsune
cf-heritage-frozen-wind-kitsune-desc = Cold resistance equal to half your level, and environmental cold is one step less extreme.

cf-heritage-draxie = Draxie
cf-heritage-draxie-desc = You can speak mind to mind with a creature you are touching, if you share a language. Your spark deals mental damage.
cf-heritage-grig = Grig
cf-heritage-grig-desc = You are trained in Performance. Your spark is a sonic note.
cf-heritage-luminous-sprite = Luminous Sprite
cf-heritage-luminous-sprite-desc = You can shed dim light. Your spark deals fire damage.
cf-heritage-melixie = Melixie
cf-heritage-melixie-desc = You can ask questions of insects and similar animals, and many of them start friendly. Your spark deals poison damage.
cf-heritage-nyktera = Nyktera
cf-heritage-nyktera-desc = You can see in darkness. Your spark is a sonic pulse.
cf-heritage-pixie = Pixie
cf-heritage-pixie-desc = You are Small instead of Tiny. Your spark is pixie dust that deals mental damage.

cf-heritage-nightglider-strix = Nightglider Strix
cf-heritage-nightglider-strix-desc = You can unfold your wings for a short time and fly at your land Speed.
cf-heritage-predator-strix = Predator Strix
cf-heritage-predator-strix-desc = The first Strike of a dive deals extra damage.
cf-heritage-scavenger-strix = Scavenger Strix
cf-heritage-scavenger-strix-desc = You are trained in Survival, and a failed Subsist check in the wild still feeds you poorly.
cf-heritage-shoreline-strix = Shoreline Strix
cf-heritage-shoreline-strix-desc = You have a swim Speed and can hold your breath longer.
cf-heritage-songbird-strix = Songbird Strix
cf-heritage-songbird-strix-desc = You are trained in Performance, and your song can Demoralize without a shared language.

cf-heritage-changeling = Changeling
cf-heritage-changeling-desc = Hag blood. You gain low-light vision, or darkvision if you already had low-light vision, and you can take changeling feats.
cf-heritage-nephilim = Nephilim
cf-heritage-nephilim-desc = Celestial, fiend, or monitor blood. You gain low-light vision, or darkvision if you already had low-light vision, and you can take nephilim feats.
cf-heritage-aiuvarin = Aiuvarin
cf-heritage-aiuvarin-desc = Elf blood. You gain low-light vision and can take elf feats as well as your own.
cf-heritage-dromaar = Dromaar
cf-heritage-dromaar-desc = Orc blood. You gain low-light vision and can take orc feats as well as your own.
cf-heritage-dhampir = Dhampir
cf-heritage-dhampir-desc = Vampire blood and void healing: vitality harms you and void heals you. Low-light vision, or darkvision if you already had low-light vision.
cf-heritage-dragonblood = Dragonblood
cf-heritage-dragonblood-desc = You may take Draconic as a language, and a success against fear becomes a critical success.
cf-heritage-duskwalker = Duskwalker
cf-heritage-duskwalker-desc = You can never become undead. Low-light vision, or darkvision if you already had low-light vision.
cf-heritage-ifrit = Ifrit
cf-heritage-ifrit-desc = Fire in the blood. Fire resistance equal to half your level, and heat is one step less extreme.
cf-heritage-oread = Oread
cf-heritage-oread-desc = Stone in the blood. You are harder to shove, trip, or knock down.
cf-heritage-suli = Suli
cf-heritage-suli-desc = You can attune a resistance to acid, cold, electricity, fire, or sonic, equal to half your level.
cf-heritage-sylph = Sylph
cf-heritage-sylph-desc = Wind in the blood. You fall more gently and are harder to push with air.
cf-heritage-undine = Undine
cf-heritage-undine-desc = Water in the blood. You can breathe underwater and you have a swim Speed.
cf-heritage-beastkin = Beastkin
cf-heritage-beastkin-desc = An animal lives in your lineage. You can take beastkin feats and show that animal's traits.
